#. +> trunk6 stable6
#: backends/julia/juliasession.cpp:336
#, kde-format
msgid ""
"For Julia only GR (https://gr-framework.org/), a framework for visualization a"
"pplications, is supported at the moment. This package has to be installed firs"
"t, if not done yet. For this, run Pkg.install(\"GR\") in Cantor or in Julia RE"
"PL. Note, this operation can take some time and it's better to perform it in J"
"ulia REPL that is able to show the current progress of the package installatio"
"n."
msgstr ""
"Para Julia de momento só se permite GR (https://gr-framework.org/), unha infra"
"estrutura para aplicacións de visualización. Primeiro ten que instalar este pa"
"quete se non o fixo xa. Para facelo, execute Pkg.install(\"GR\") en Cantor ou "
"no REPL de Julia. Teña en conta que esta operación pode levar un tempo e é mel"
"lor realizala no REPL de Julia, que pode amosar o progreso da instalación do p"
"aquete."

